# Student Performance AI Pipeline Config
# Duplicate this file as '.env' and fill in your actual credentials.

# ── Report engine ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# local   (default) rule engine. No network, no API key, no cost. Ever.
# gemini  opt-in LLM path. Only this value can ever produce a bill.
REPORT_ENGINE=local

# Model used when REPORT_ENGINE=gemini.
# The flash-lite tier is the cheapest and has a free quota. Prefer the floating
# alias: pinned versions get retired for new users and then 404.
REPORT_MODEL=gemini-flash-lite-latest

# ── Credentials ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only read when REPORT_ENGINE=gemini. Ignored entirely on the local engine.
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Cost notes:
#   - Identical records are served from .report_cache/, so re-runs bill nothing.
#   - The prompt ships a compacted record, not the full document dump.
#   - Thinking budget is 0 and output is capped at 8192 tokens.
#   - Output shape is identical on both engines, so 'local' is a safe default.
